<https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                        owl:versionIRI <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/1.0/> ;
                                                        owl:imports <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core> ;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4970-4554> ,
                                                                                           <https://orcid.org/0009-0001-1596-8642> ,
                                                                                           <https://orcid.org/0009-0006-5558-4295> ;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The Hereditary ontology models phenoclinical, genomics and scientific aspects of the gut-brain axis to provide a unifying layer to query different database sources through an Ontology-Based Data Access (OBDA) framework. This part of the ontology focuses on gut-brain data."@en ;
